# Copy to encode-profiles.csv (git-ignored) and edit. UTF-8. One "key,profile" per line.
# A recording whose file name contains the key (case-insensitive) is encoded with the profile.
# The first matching line wins: put specific keys above general ones.
# Recordings that match no line are skipped. Keys and profile names must not contain a comma.
# The profile must exist in Amatsukaze (case-sensitive).
#
# key,profile
EXAMPLE_KEY,EXAMPLE_PROFILE
